{"asset_key":"ep5/quest_story_15213590","episode":"ep5","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15213590","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1521359001:0":{"text":"マルコさんの状況は？彼は……元気にしているのでしょうか……？","source_cn":"你们打听到马尔科的消息了吗？他……他还好吗？<key:...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF6784F085B8CBE06","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1521359002:0":{"text":"彼は戦場で負傷し、今も拠点の施設で治療を受けています。","source_cn":"他在战场上受了伤，现在还在军营里接受治疗。<key:d...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF1D91E3772F94516","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1521359003:0":{"text":"手紙を預かってきました。","source_cn":"他写了一封信，托我们转交给你。<key:dialog2>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x06825BE7023DFDBB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1521359004:0":{"text":"負傷って、彼は無事なんですよね……手紙、見せてください！","source_cn":"没事就好，没事就好……我看看他的信。<key:dial...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCBCBE9830B9E73AA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1521359005:0":{"text":"フルアはマルコの手紙に目を通すと、すぐさま顔が青ざめていった。","source_cn":"芙接过马尔科写的信。但很快，她的脸色就变得苍白。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE099890A1F7657FD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_fema